      "name": "Primary link",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "primary-link",
      "description": "The filled Home action leading to Work.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-primary\" href=\"#work\">Explore my work <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Onest\",Arial,sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;padding:14px 24px;min-height:50px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink,#1d1d1f);color:var(--paper,#f5f5f7);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none}.ds-primary svg{width:18px;height:18px;transition:transform .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-primary:hover{background:#38383c}.ds-primary:hover svg{transform:translateX(3px)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1d1f);outline-offset:6px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary svg{transition:none}}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-action,0 6px 16px rgb(29 29 31 / .12))}}.ds-primary:active{transform:scale(.985);box-shadow:none}.ds-primary:focus-visible{box-shadow:var(--shadow-action,0 6px 16px rgb(29 29 31 / .12))}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary,.ds-primary svg{transform:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text link",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "text-link",
      "description": "Inline navigation and download actions.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-text\" href=\"#about\">A little about me <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-text{font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Onest\",Arial,sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#1d1d1f);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:44px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;text-decoration:none}.ds-text svg{width:19px;height:19px;transition:transform .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-text:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.ds-text:hover svg{transform:translateX(3px)}.ds-text:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1d1f);outline-offset:6px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-text svg{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Main navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "main-navigation",
      "description": "Compact navigation with current-page and hover underlines.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#home\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"#work\">Work</a><a href=\"#about\">About</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Onest\",Arial,sans-serif);display:flex;gap:28px;background:var(--paper,#f5f5f7)}.ds-nav a{position:relative;color:var(--muted,#626267);padding:12px 0;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}.ds-nav a:hover,.ds-nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--ink,#1d1d1f)}.ds-nav a::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:7px;height:1px;background:currentColor;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-nav a:hover::after,.ds-nav a[aria-current]::after{transform:scaleX(1)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1d1f);outline-offset:6px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-nav{gap:15px}.ds-nav a{font-size:11px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav a::after{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Research project text",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "research-project",
      "description": "Open project title and contribution beneath the rounded image; all four projects remain visible.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-project\"><h3>A toolkit for conversations in Forres.</h3><a class=\"ds-project-open\" href=\"#forres\">Read case study <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a><div class=\"ds-project-detail\"><h4>The contribution</h4><p>A puzzle and discussion guide, refined with stakeholders and handed over to FACT.</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-project{font-family:var(--font-reading,\"Onest\",Arial,sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#1d1d1f)}.ds-project h3{font-family:var(--font-display,\"Hanken Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif);font-size:32px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0}.ds-project-open{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:inherit;font-size:12px;min-height:40px;margin-top:12px;text-decoration:none}.ds-project-open svg{width:17px;height:17px}.ds-project-open:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.ds-project-open:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#1d1d1f);outline-offset:6px}.ds-project-detail{border-top:1px solid var(--line,#d8d8dc);padding-top:24px;margin-top:24px}.ds-project h4{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 9px}.ds-project p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-project h3{font-size:29px}}"
    },
